 * 2. Flash loan attack simulation
 * 3. Front-running y sandwich attacks
 * 4. Price manipulation
 * 5. Gas griefing attacks
 * 6. Timing manipulation
 * 7. Storage collision attacks
 * 8. Cross-function reentrancy
